  Tab             cycle panes       Shift+R         refresh            Ctrl+L          redraw
  ,               settings          t               theme              ]               snippets
  ?               help              Shift+T         tour               Shift+D         sync status
  Shift+M         messages          Esc             dismiss            `               jump to workspace
  !               next asking       Shift+F         next failing       .               focus mode
  Shift+W         start agent       Shift+P         activity pane      Shift+Arrows    resize splitters
  Workspace
  Enter           open              w               work on this       s               shell
  e               editor            m               mark read          z               snooze
  Shift+Z         long snooze       Shift+N         new workspace      n               new workspace
  r               reply             Shift+A         adopt sessions     Shift+J         join into PR
  Shift+X         archive           Shift+C         close issue
  Sidebar
  f               filter            o               sort               Shift+S         mailbox
  /               search            Space           collapse group     v               select
  Shift+B         broadcast
  Activity
  Enter           toggle section    →/←             expand/collapse    g               top
  Shift+G         bottom            d               description        Space           select row
  z               undo mark-read
  Terminal
  Shift+PgUp/Dn   scroll            ]]              exit to sidebar    ]]<key>         snippets
